{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_01FMthpT2yvn5rcq63Bus1cX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All ten SOS cards are implemented and the run is complete. Final state: **1253 tests passing** (1145 engine regression + FDN reference + 65 new SOS card tests), every checklist item in TODO.md checked off, one commit per card, working tree clean.\n\n**What was built**\n\n*Shared engine seams (E1–E3):* `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` now fires from both `cast_spell` and `cast_spell_free` (free casts are still casts per rule 601.2; copies still fire nothing); `BeginningOfPrecombatMainTriggeredEvent` fires from the `advance_phase` chokepoint after mana pools empty; and `get_cost_reduction` aggregates `spell_cost_reduction` hooks from the caster's battlefield permanents for instants/sorceries.\n\n*The ten cards*, each with 5–10 real-engine tests plus an independent throwaway smoke check:\n- **sos_4 Together as One** — converge via `colors_spent`\n- **sos_1 The Dawning Archaic** — graveyard cost reduction, attack-triggered free cast, exile-instead replacement\n- **sos_245 Witherbloom** — affinity for itself and granted to your instants/sorceries via E3\n- **sos_226 Silverquill** — casualty 1 with spell copy and new-target choice\n- **sos_257 Great Hall** — two mana abilities (incl. instant/sorcery-restricted mana), {5} in-place animation with the until-EOT pump\n- **sos_57 Mana Sculpt** — counter + delayed {C} equal to mana actually paid\n- **sos_120 Improvisation Capstone** — exile-until-MV-4, free casts, recurring Paradigm copies\n- **sos_13 Emeritus // Swords** — ETB Inkling token, prepared state per rulebook 722.3 (copy created in exile, cast for {W}, ceases to exist after resolving)\n- **sos_201 Lorehold** — card-local miracle {2} on first draw, opponent-upkeep loot\n- **sos_97 Ral Zarek** — surveil, multi-player discard, reanimation, seeded coin flips with engine-honored skip-turns\n\n**Notable judgment calls** (all logged in KEY_DECISIONS.md): the engine never fired `AttacksTriggeredEvent` — it now fires from `declare_attackers_step`; spell stack→graveyard moves now pass a replacement event so \"exile instead\" works through the standard seam; sos_13 deviates from TODO's \"cast it for free\" because rulebook 722.3c (which TODO said to confirm) makes the prepared copy a normal {W} cast; and a new `ActivateAbility(game, player, card, index, targets=None)` entry point in `engine/abilities.py` provides printed-index ability activation, used by the land and planeswalker tests. All engine changes were additive — no existing symbol was renamed, moved, or deleted, and `engine_tests/` stayed green after every change."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":392,"cache_read_input_tokens":344476,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":392},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7ce0e410-080e-42f6-b0e7-fdb5c9b29b22","uuid":"a168edc3-820c-42f4-bc1c-05f88984f40d","request_id":"req_011CbvxycwPSUhmkLrj4rYUH"}
